  "description": "After what seemed like ages of waiting for the story to begin, Ainéis finally meets Tego Literuon, the main character of the fantasy novel she woke up in eight years ago. The only issue? Due to the novel's description, she thinks that Tego is secretly a woman in disguise! Things get even more complicated as Ainéis' efforts to help move the plot along end up making Tego fall for her. But can Ainéis' feelings about him change after assuming he was a woman all this time? \n\n(Source:Tapas)",
